{"slug":"UPD-Hood-Rivals-HeadHitbox-x5-opensource-228096","_id":"6aa71a418e1707dd0e6068e6","title":"HeadHitbox x5 opensource","game":{"_id":"6a80cebe2a2bad7afdcd9abc","gameId":77463332823746,"name":"Hood Rivals","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":77463332823746},"features":"juste headHitbox x5 on Hood Rivals\n\nShooting anywhere on the head hitbox hits the person's head, so you can kill people in 3 shots without even having to aim, lol.","tags":["hitbox","head","aimbot","script"],"script":"local Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal LP = Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal S = 5\n\nlocal function apply(char)\n    local hb = char:FindFirstChild(\"HeadHitbox\")\n    if hb then\n        hb.Size *= S\n        hb.Transparency = 0.5\n        hb.CanCollide = false\n    end\nend\n\nlocal function hook(p)\n    if p == LP then return end\n    if p.Character then apply(p.Character) end\n    p.CharacterAdded:Connect(function(c) task.wait(1); apply(c) end)\nend\n\nfor _, p in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do hook(p) end\nPlayers.PlayerAdded:Connect(hook)","owner":{"_id":"696c44a4a601210e73dc0d58","username":"rifiano","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/caf4549ce51b0c94b7fb7b2f5b94242e465d906f9ca3f57d6701635aeeb05e08.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/696c44a4a601210e73dc0d58-1769449499249.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"696c44a4a601210e73dc0d58","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/caf4549ce51b0c94b7fb7b2f5b94242e465d906f9ca3f57d6701635aeeb05e08.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/696c44a4a601210e73dc0d58-1769449499249.jpg"}},"verified":false,"keyless":false,"views":2394,"executes":23682,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/905054182dd5ba2e2d3e5093f417